Example question/query pairs (top-5 most similar past questions):

Example 1:
Question: Which film actors (actresses) played a role in more than 30 films? List his or her first name and last name.
Query: db.film_actor.aggregate([{"$group": {"_id": "$actor_id", "count": {"$sum": 1}}}, {"$match": {"count": {"$gt": 30}}}, {"$lookup": {"from": "actor", "localField": "_id", "foreignField": "actor_id", "as": "a"}}, {"$unwind": "$a"}, {"$project": {"_id": 0, "first_name": "$a.first_name", "last_name": "$a.last_name"}}])

Example 2:
Question: Which film has the most number of actors or actresses? List the film name, film id and description.
Query: db.film_actor.aggregate([{"$group": {"_id": "$film_id", "count": {"$sum": 1}}}, {"$sort": {"count": -1}}, {"$limit": 1}, {"$lookup": {"from": "film", "localField": "_id", "foreignField": "film_id", "as": "f"}}, {"$unwind": "$f"}, {"$project": {"_id": 0, "title": "$f.title", "film_id": "$_id", "description": "$f.description"}}])

Example 3:
Question: What is the most popular first name of the actors?
Query: db.actor.aggregate([{"$group": {"_id": "$first_name", "count": {"$sum": 1}}}, {"$sort": {"count": -1}}, {"$limit": 1}, {"$project": {"_id": 0, "first_name": "$_id"}}])

Example 4:
Question: What is the most popular full name of the actors?
Query: db.actor.aggregate([{"$group": {"_id": {"first_name": "$first_name", "last_name": "$last_name"}, "count": {"$sum": 1}}}, {"$sort": {"count": -1}}, {"$limit": 1}, {"$project": {"_id": 0, "first_name": "$_id.first_name", "last_name": "$_id.last_name"}}])

Example 5:
Question: How many different last names do the actors and actresses have?
Query: db.actor.aggregate([{"$group": {"_id": "$last_name"}}, {"$count": "count"}])

